{"parse": {"title": "飞渡往日-03", "pageid": 55485, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-02\" title=\"飞渡往日-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">飞渡往日-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-04\" title=\"飞渡往日-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">飞渡往日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BC.8A.E5.8D.A1.E6.B4.9B.E6.96.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"伊卡洛斯\">伊卡洛斯</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 伊卡洛斯</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Icarus</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1960103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>呼……他们走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你父亲留下的东西帮了不少忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很快就能修好。调整一下，明天试飞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>这么说还是有好消息的，我也有消息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说到这里，她却有些不好意思开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>我打算先离开里斯本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯。那飞行器呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>先就这样吧，我可以带到新大陆去继续研究，带着它和我们的设计稿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>也就是说，我出局了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>我不是这个意思……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>如果你在那边能更好地完成这件事，那么祝贺你，希梅娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士停下手头的活儿，望向助手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>十五分钟后会有船在海边接我，他们答应好了。我想带着东西离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但我认为留在里斯本会更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>欧洲有更多资源供我们使用，新英格兰什么也没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>但在这儿我随时可能跟那些家伙一起去蹲监狱，我可不想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不想？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士感到不解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>我说了，我可以把这些东西带到新大陆去，这个研究没问题，我自己一个人也可以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>徒劳的狡辩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>再说了，这是我父亲留给我的遗产，你看，这些是我的，而不是你父亲留给你的，不是吗？只是因为他给英国朋友写了信，所以你才来帮我……我可以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个谎言，为了体面，也为了求生。她在动摇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:133%\">她在害怕。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你父亲留下了一个梦想给你，而瓦特先生留给我的则是这枚活塞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>他希望我离开实验室，走出斯塔福德郡的工坊，去见见更多的人，倾听更多的思想与想象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>通过合作，人类才得以狩猎大型猎物，进而形成聚落，制造工具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指向自己身体的核心。一个永恒的理念，一种不竭的活力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没什么好担心的。我们的合作已经让这个梦想距它出发时走出了很远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>我看不到成功，更不觉得为这个飘渺的希望继续坚持下去有什么好处……露西……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>九秒钟和六秒钟有什么区别呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对提问，机械女士没有作答。她收起设备，将机翼折好，走向教堂大门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>露西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>现在风况很好，抓紧时间，希梅娜。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>风力远不足以让这样的结构支撑起成年人的体重，腾空飞起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>或许在精巧的结构设计和自然力的支持下能实现短时间的滑翔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人走向海岸，行将离别之际，却像过去那样讨论着飞行机器的设计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>风车？还是水车？难道要用像你一样的蒸汽吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>坦白说，我不知道。加装蒸汽机或许是可行的方案，但那太重了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>在这之外，神秘术也是一条可行之道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>神秘术？别……别……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>希梅娜连连摇头，似乎为这个词而恐惧，犹如旧日的幽灵从唇齿间的发音中被唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，神秘术不能从根本上解决问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这条路上没有捷径可走，不可能每一次起飞都依赖神秘术的辅助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你跟我认识的其他神秘学家同胞都不太一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>同胞？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>我的家族以前都在船上干活，就是用我们的神秘术替走私船预测风向和海况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>直到一次失误。总之那是个糟糕的事故……爸爸为此丧命，那时候他就是为了做这对翅膀，才去新英格兰采买材料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个误判，一次海难，一场对幸存者的私刑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是一种迷信，就像水手认为出海时不能向陆地回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>为什么会诞生这些规则？这种极小幅度的肢体动作不会对船舶航行造成任何影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>因为那意味着你还没有准备好拥抱大海，还没有胆子迎接大海的挑战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>自然世界应当不存在智慧生命才具备的情感功能，希梅娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是人类的一厢情愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>是人类以及神秘学家的一厢情愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>把更多精力花在改善海航器械上，会比浪费在这些毫无价值的仪式上更有价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>一个不安的水手是没办法在船上好好干活的。人们信神，从而得到力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>力量在于他们的经验和凝聚着航海技术精华的机械造物，以及适当的好运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好运，是的，总会在恰到好处的时候溜走的、狡猾的好运……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海岸的另一端，追猎着神秘学家的火光一如刚才那般向两人走近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卫兵：</div><div>她在海岸上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>该死！他们来得比船快！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙滩空空荡荡，先前停靠岸边的小舟都已经遁入大海，而与她约定的船只却不见踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>船呢？船为什么还没靠岸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手足无措的神秘学家看向深蓝大海，灯塔光亮扫过海面，一只只小船正驶向远方，或停在海面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她得自己想办法渡过数百米大海，飞上迎接她的船只的甲板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听见金属碰撞的响声越发接近，军靴践踏海岸，仿佛猎狗紧追的咆哮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>还有一个办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>把飞行器给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这并非科学的成功，也并非研究的成就，而只是一个权宜之计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘术的辉光显现，蒸汽随机械女士的活塞核心运转而轰鸣着排出，将那层覆满奥秘的铁青色涂上机翼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>这、这是什么？你从没跟我说过这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你对它……做了什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>也许能让你飞起来，我不敢保证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金属翅膀随风扇动，像是展翅待飞的雏鹰，将希梅娜赶往海岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>控制好高度，然后向最近的那艘船飞去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>压低身子，尽量与海面平行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>如果我落水了，他们会把我抓走的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你留在这里，也会被带走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>希梅娜忐忑不安，这时却也只能相信伙伴，迈步跑向大海。沿途踩下的脚印，旋即便被冲上沙滩的海浪吞没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她挥打着双臂，踩过浪花，在海水没过膝盖时奋力跃出——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>展开手臂，压低身体，保持平衡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>露西——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不安地振翅飞起，滑向高高的远天，风却稳稳地接住了远行之人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_haianbianluxi\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_haianbianluxi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她离海平线上的落日越来越近，离陆地母亲却越来越远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船桅的形影将要消失在大海尽头，机械女士不确定她那位同伴是否平安落到了甲板上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士望向翱翔于海天之间的那只飞鸟，希梅娜似乎颇为惊讶这期盼多时的自由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在风中摇荡，摇摇晃晃飞向远方的航船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>她飞走了，先生们，你们来迟了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卫兵：</div><div>你放走了她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不，我和你们一样，无力阻止一位能飞上天空的逃亡者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卫兵：</div><div>开火！把她打下来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来自英格兰的客人并非卫兵的猎物。看到伙伴飞走，机械女士没能为这“成功”高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>依靠自己的神秘术完成的飞行奇迹，并非她所渴望见到的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士就此转身离去，走回海岸尽头的城镇。<br />里斯本城墙上灯火通明，她隐隐能够听见港口吹起的长号声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们做过很多尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>从材料到结构，从结构再到数学的魔术，直到神秘术这条不可复制的捷径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>她做得很好，却停在了路的半途。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如同一只被耗尽了耐心的惊弓之鸟，将梦想抛诸脑后，依靠着不可复制的奇迹匆忙逃走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士停下脚步。没有人来追赶她，身后的士兵向着天空开枪，徒劳地瞄准远远飞走的希梅娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海潮涨起又退下，螃蟹从沙坑里爬出，举起蟹钳敲击着挡在身前的“钢铁巨物”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯？徒劳的击打，你想要我让开，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，坚硬的几丁质有机物，但它的强度对金属表壳来说没有意义。你的重量和体积都不足以对这副身躯造成伤害，节肢动物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蹲下去，抓起螃蟹，细细地端详一阵后，又将其放回盐湿的海岸，水浪不多久便将这小小的造物卷入大海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那只离岸的海鸟已经飞了太久，没有任何一根命运的丝线将希梅娜与大地或大海相连。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海鸟滑翔空中，如同一只随风逐流的水母，飘向比落日更远的远海，朝着离港的航船追去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>要找到一条真正可行的道路，人类无可避免地要为此付出代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>时间、信心和勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但现在，你放弃了，希梅娜。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "飞渡往日-03"}}